/**
 * Frozen default panel visibility with only toolbar visible.
 *
 *  * [👤compose📚js🗃️sketchpad💻shared🔖types🔖granularhooktypes🔖standardemptyconstants🪨emptypanelvisibility](composerepo://p/u/compose/b/l/js/fd/org/sketchpad/f/shared.ts/s/Types/s/Granular%20Hook%20Types/s/Standard%20Empty%20Constants/d/i/EMPTY_PANEL_VISIBILITY)
