 * Yjs-backed type store managing architectural type definitions and their connectors.
 *
 *  * [👤compose📚js🗃️sketchpad💻sketchpad🔖type🛠️typestore](composerepo://p/u/compose/b/l/js/fd/org/sketchpad/f/Sketchpad.tsx/s/Type/d/i/TypeStore)
