/**
 * [👤compose📚js🗃️sketchpad💻sketchpad🔖store🔖connection🪨connectionscopecontext](composerepo://p/u/compose/b/l/js/fd/org/sketchpad/f/Sketchpad.tsx/s/Store/s/Connection/d/i/ConnectionScopeContext)
