 *  * [👤compose📚js🗃️sketchpad💻sketchpad🔖piece🛠️usepiecedepth](composerepo://p/u/compose/b/l/js/fd/org/sketchpad/f/Sketchpad.tsx/s/Piece/d/i/usePieceDepth)
 **/
