/**
// [👤compose📚js🗃️sketchpad💻sketchpad🔖utilities🔖store🔖plainappstorenoyjs🔖kits🛠️attributestore](composerepo://p/u/compose/b/l/js/fd/org/sketchpad/f/Sketchpad.tsx/s/Utilities/s/Store/s/Plain%20App%20Store%20(No%20YJS)/s/Kits/d/i/AttributeStore)
