/** logStateAccess holds the data fields for a logStateAccess record.
// [👤compose📚js🗃️sketchpad💻sketchpad🔖apps🔖sketchpad🛠️logstateaccess](composerepo://p/u/compose/b/l/js/fd/org/sketchpad/f/Sketchpad.tsx/s/Apps/s/Sketchpad/d/i/logStateAccess)
