/**
 * Component rendering the full canvas layout with window configuration.
 *
 *  * [👤compose📚js🗃️sketchpad💻sketchpad🔖canvas🪨layoutcanvas](composerepo://p/u/compose/b/l/js/fd/org/sketchpad/f/Sketchpad.tsx/s/Canvas/d/i/LayoutCanvas)
