/**
 * Configuration interface for a side panel tab.
 *
 *  * [👤compose📚js🗃️sketchpad💻elements🔖panelcomponents🔖sidepanel🛠️sidepaneltabconfig](composerepo://p/u/compose/b/l/js/fd/org/sketchpad/f/elements.tsx/s/Panel%20Components/s/SidePanel/d/i/SidePanelTabConfig)
