/**
 * [👤compose📚js🗃️sketchpad💻elements🔖inputcomponents🔖stepper✂️stepperprops](composerepo://p/u/compose/b/l/js/fd/org/sketchpad/f/elements.tsx/s/Input%20Components/s/Stepper/d/i/StepperProps)
